<title>USA: Playboy to launch Scandinavian edition.</title>
<headline>Playboy to launch Scandinavian edition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Playboy Enterprises Inc plans to publish a Scandinavian edition of Playboy magazine in conjunction with Media Holding ASA, a Scandinavian media company, the two companies said Tuesday.</p>
<p>A bi-monthly magazine will be distributed in Norway starting with the December 1997/January 1998 edition, and distribution in Sweden, Finland and Denmark is expected over the next few years, the companies said.</p>
<p>The companies said the magazine agreement was signed today.</p>
<p>The Scandinavian Playboy will be the 16th overseas edition of the magazine.</p>
<p>	  ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
